Z||000032||FieroMike||07-06-99||02:05 PM||||SCCA Fiero,<br>That grommet on the front valve cover is the crankcase fresh air inlet.  There should be a tube that runs from the intake hose, back up against the firewall and then accross to that grommet.<br>L8er
